# =============================================================================
# Root environment example
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This monorepo uses per-workspace .env files:
#   - backend/.env   (server secrets: Requesty API key, model ids, port)
#   - frontend/.env  (public Vite config: VITE_API_BASE_URL)
#
# Copy each workspace's .env.example to .env and fill in the values.
# This root file exists only as documentation.
# =============================================================================
